  "detailed_description": "&quot;A Scheme to Provide Assistance for Building E-Market Facilities in Market Committees&quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support market committees to set up e-market facilities, enhancing transparency and efficiency in agricultural marketing across the state.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. Co-operative Market Committees shall be eligible under this scheme.\n   1. The committee must operate within Gujarat.\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
